translate zh qst_DamzelDizzt_3_ruckus_TarekDead_e45f5339:

    # "Lifeless bodies fell to the floor, one upon another, torn to shreds by tooth and claw as both me and 马库斯 greedily began to rip apart and devour pieces of their flesh."
    "无生命的尸体一个接一个地倒在地板上，被牙齿和爪子撕成碎片，我和马库斯贪婪地开始撕扯并吞食他们的肉块。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_3.rpy:118
